    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Loon4Mac build 1007：M1 Max 本地 TCP 性能与测试方法]]></title>
        <id>https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance</id>
        <link href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance"/>
        <updated>2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[在 Apple M1 Max 上测试 Loon4Mac 的本地 NE TCP 转发，记录单流与四流上传下载吞吐、网络扩展 RSS，并提供配置、自动脚本和手动测试步骤。]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>即将发布的 <strong>Loon4Mac build 1007</strong> 带来了 TCP 转发性能优化。在 Apple M1 Max 上的发布前本地验证中，单流上传达到 <strong>12.25 Gbps</strong>、单流下载达到 <strong>13.97 Gbps</strong>；四流下载合计达到 <strong>20.61 Gbps</strong>，网络扩展进程的 RSS 采样峰值约 <strong>90.23 MiB</strong>。</p>
<p>本文先说明测试环境、配置和结果，再给出可以自行复现的测试方法。这里测量的是经过 Loon 网络扩展与 TCP 栈的本地转发能力，不是互联网测速，也不是绕过 Loon 的原生回环速度。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="一测试环境配置与结果">一、测试环境、配置与结果<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E4%B8%80%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C" class="hash-link" aria-label="一、测试环境、配置与结果的直接链接" title="一、测试环境、配置与结果的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="版本与测试范围">版本与测试范围<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4" class="hash-link" aria-label="版本与测试范围的直接链接" title="版本与测试范围的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>本文对应即将发布的 <strong>build 1007</strong>，记录该版本 TCP 优化实现的发布前验证结果。发布版本号与测试构建标识分开记录：本轮内部验证构建的网络扩展仍自报 <code>0.4.0 (991)</code>；这些数据不是对最终 build 1007 发布包重新安装后的独立复测。</p>
<p>本轮只测试 IPv4 TCP，上传和下载分别执行，不是同时双向传输。每个场景只测一次，用于开发验证，不是多轮平均值或长时间稳定性认证。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="测试环境">测试环境<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83" class="hash-link" aria-label="测试环境的直接链接" title="测试环境的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>本轮环境</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>测试日期</td><td>2026 年 10 月 20 日</td></tr><tr><td>对应发布版本</td><td>Loon4Mac build 1007（即将发布）</td></tr><tr><td>实测内部构建标识</td><td>网络扩展 <code>0.4.0 (991)</code>；发布前验证构建</td></tr><tr><td>设备</td><td>搭载 Apple M1 Max 的 MacBook Pro</td></tr><tr><td>CPU / 内存</td><td>10 核 CPU / 32 GiB 统一内存</td></tr><tr><td>系统</td><td>macOS 27.2，系统构建号 <code>26B5101f</code></td></tr><tr><td>电源与温控</td><td>接通电源；测试开始时系统未记录温控或性能警告</td></tr><tr><td>测试工具</td><td><code>/usr/bin/iperf3-darwin</code>，iperf 3.8.1，Apple 版本 <code>iperf3-135</code></td></tr><tr><td>执行架构</td><td>通过 <code>arch -arm64</code> 运行</td></tr><tr><td>网络扩展</td><td>Loon system extension；用户重启后测试，测试期间实例未变化</td></tr><tr><td>TUN</td><td>本轮为 <code>utun9</code>，MTU 4000</td></tr><tr><td>资源采集</td><td>约每秒采集一次 NE 进程 RSS / CPU；未测 physical footprint</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>接口编号、Fake-IP 和进程 PID 都可能在重启后改变，不应照抄为固定值。测试期间系统仍可能有后台活动，结果不是完全隔离环境下的硬件极限。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="测试配置与流量路径">测试配置与流量路径<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84" class="hash-link" aria-label="测试配置与流量路径的直接链接" title="测试配置与流量路径的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>本轮保留 Loon NE、Fake-IP DNS 和规则模式，通过 Host 映射把测试域名的实际出口指向本机：</p>
<div class="language-ini codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-ini codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[Host]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">bench.loon.test = 127.0.0.1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[Rule]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">DOMAIN,bench.loon.test,DIRECT</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>客户端访问 <code>bench.loon.test</code>，系统得到的是 Loon 分配的 Fake-IP；Loon 接管连接后，再按 Host 映射连接 <code>127.0.0.1</code> 上的 iperf 服务端。<code>DIRECT</code> 表示 Loon 的出口直连，<strong>不是绕过 Loon TCP 栈</strong>。</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">iperf 客户端</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    ↕ 系统 TCP / Fake-IP / utun</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">Loon NE 与 lwIP TCP 栈</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    ↕ Loon DIRECT socket</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">本机 127.0.0.1 上的 iperf 服务端</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>本轮 Fake-IP 为 <code>198.0.5.95</code>，本机 TUN IPv4 为 <code>198.19.0.1</code>。每个场景前后都检查了路由和扩展身份，并将端口与 Loon 的 TUN 连接日志、DIRECT 规则记录、TCP 栈收发计数关联，确认流量经过 Loon。</p>
<p>网关和 DHCP 在此次环境中保持开启，但压力流量由 Mac 本机发起，不是局域网设备经网关发起；复现本地测试不需要开启网关或 DHCP。没有使用远程代理节点，也没有对这条连接做 TLS 解密。结果不包含远程节点加密、广域网 RTT 或物理网卡带宽的限制。</p>
<p>测试顺序与参数：</p>
<ul>
<li>单流上传 → 单流下载 → 四流上传 → 四流下载，每项一次。</li>
<li>每项先预热 2 秒，再测量 10 秒，场景之间间隔约 2 秒。</li>
<li>测试前空载观察约 10 秒，全部吞吐测试结束后继续观察约 30 秒。</li>
<li>速度使用接收端吞吐；四流使用四条连接合计值。</li>
<li>没有额外设置 iperf 的 TCP 窗口、应用写块大小或零拷贝选项。</li>
<li>本轮启用了开发诊断计数；报告数值并非“关闭所有诊断后的峰值”。</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="吞吐与内存">吞吐与内存<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E5%90%9E%E5%90%90%E4%B8%8E%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98" class="hash-link" aria-label="吞吐与内存的直接链接" title="吞吐与内存的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>测试场景</th><th style="text-align:right">接收吞吐</th><th style="text-align:right">NE RSS 中位数</th><th style="text-align:right">NE RSS 采样峰值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>单流上传</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>12.25 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">55.36 MiB</td><td style="text-align:right">55.70 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>单流下载</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>13.97 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">59.06 MiB</td><td style="text-align:right">59.28 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>四流上传合计</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>10.67 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">58.81 MiB</td><td style="text-align:right">60.55 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>四流下载合计</td><td style="text-align:right"><strong>20.61 Gbps</strong></td><td style="text-align:right">87.43 MiB</td><td style="text-align:right">90.23 MiB</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><code>Gbps</code> 是十进制每秒十亿比特，不是 GB/s；<code>MiB</code> 是 1,048,576 字节。四流的 20.61 Gbps 是总吞吐，不能写成单条连接达到 20 Gbps。</p>
<p>内存是<strong>整个 Loon 网络扩展进程的 RSS</strong>，不是某条 TCP 连接的独占内存，不包含宿主 App 和两个 iperf 进程。约 1 Hz 采样可能遗漏更短暂的峰值；RSS 也不等同于系统内存压力、堆中存活对象大小或 physical footprint。</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>观察阶段</th><th style="text-align:right">NE RSS 中位数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>测试前空载</td><td style="text-align:right">46.45 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>停流后 0–5 秒</td><td style="text-align:right">89.98 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>停流后 5–15 秒</td><td style="text-align:right">90.03 MiB</td></tr><tr><td>停流后 15–30 秒</td><td style="text-align:right">90.00 MiB</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>停流后没有立即回到初始 RSS，末段仍高出约 43.55 MiB。这可能涉及分配器保留内存、尚存活对象或其他业务；仅凭这段 RSS 曲线不能判定内存泄漏，也不能宣称内存已全部释放。</p>
<p>同一实现此前一次独立四流测试得到下载合计 19.95 Gbps、RSS 峰值 89.05 MiB；本轮重启后连续测单流和四流，结果处在相近范围。但两轮顺序和初始状态不同，不作为严格重复统计。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="如何理解这些数字">如何理解这些数字<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97" class="hash-link" aria-label="如何理解这些数字的直接链接" title="如何理解这些数字的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>这轮结果说明，在当前环境与配置下，Loon 的本地 NE 路径可以持续完成约 12–14 Gbps 的单流 TCP 传输，并在四流下载时提供约 20.6 Gbps 的总吞吐。</p>
<p>它不意味着 Wi-Fi、以太网或互联网下载也能达到同样速度，更不能直接换算为其他芯片上的成绩。四流上传没有高于单流上传，也说明增加连接数并不必然增加总吞吐。比较不同软件或版本时，需要统一设备、系统、MTU、iperf 版本、流数、预热和统计口径。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="二如何自行测试">二、如何自行测试<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#%E4%BA%8C%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95" class="hash-link" aria-label="二、如何自行测试的直接链接" title="二、如何自行测试的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="1-准备-loon-配置">1. 准备 Loon 配置<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#1-%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87-loon-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE" class="hash-link" aria-label="1. 准备 Loon 配置的直接链接" title="1. 准备 Loon 配置的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>将以下内容<strong>合并到现有配置的对应段落</strong>，不要覆盖整份配置：</p>
<div class="language-ini codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-ini codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[Host]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">bench.loon.test = 127.0.0.1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">[Rule]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 放在可能提前命中的规则和 FINAL 之前</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">DOMAIN,bench.loon.test,DIRECT</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>同时确认：</p>
<ol>
<li>Loon VPN 已连接，使用规则模式，其他 VPN 已关闭。</li>
<li><code>bench.loon.test</code> 没有被 <code>real-ip</code> 列表及通配符覆盖。</li>
<li>不要把该域名写入系统 <code>/etc/hosts</code>，否则可能直接解析到回环地址。</li>
<li>检查插件规则是否提前匹配了该域名；本测试不需要 MITM。</li>
<li>接通电源，暂停大文件下载和高负载任务，测试期间不切换配置、不重启 NE。</li>
</ol>
<p>如需比较重启后的内存，先自行重启 NE，再执行整组测试，不要只在某个场景前重启。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="2-确认工具和路径">2. 确认工具和路径<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#2-%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%92%8C%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84" class="hash-link" aria-label="2. 确认工具和路径的直接链接" title="2. 确认工具和路径的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>本文使用系统提供的 Apple 版 iperf：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin --version</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">dscacheutil -q host -a name bench.loon.test</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">route -n get bench.loon.test</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>应看到域名解析为 Fake-IP，路由接口为 <code>utunN</code>。再用实际接口名查看 MTU，例如：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ifconfig utun9</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p><strong>如果目标变成 <code>127.0.0.1</code>，或路由接口是 <code>lo0</code>，请停止测试并检查配置。</strong> 那样测到的是原生回环，而不是 Loon NE。若目标走物理网卡，也不符合本测试路径。</p>
<p>本轮使用 MTU 4000，复测时应记录自己的实际 MTU；不要为了“对齐数字”在测试期间临时修改接口。若系统没有 <code>/usr/bin/iperf3-darwin</code>，可以使用自己安装的 iperf3，但需要记录版本，不能假设不同实现和版本完全同口径。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="3-一次执行四项的测试脚本">3. 一次执行四项的测试脚本<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#3-%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9B%E9%A1%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC" class="hash-link" aria-label="3. 一次执行四项的测试脚本的直接链接" title="3. 一次执行四项的测试脚本的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>下面是面向读者的简化 Bash 脚本，<strong>不是生成上文历史数据的内部执行器</strong>。它沿用四项顺序、预热和测量时间，自动启动仅监听回环的服务端，并记录 NE RSS / CPU。它不会修改 Loon 配置或启动、关闭 NE。</p>
<p>将代码保存为 <code>loon-ne-tcp.sh</code>，在希望保存结果的目录执行：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">bash loon-ne-tcp.sh</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>需要系统自带的 Bash、Apple 版 iperf，以及运行中的 Loon system extension；无需 sudo。端口 5201 必须空闲。输出保存在当前目录下新建的 <code>loon-ne-tcp.XXXXXX</code> 文件夹，不会覆盖已有报告。</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">#!/bin/bash</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">set -euo pipefail</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">domain=bench.loon.test</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">port=5201</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">bundle=com.loon.Loon.LoonTunnelExtension</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">server_pid=</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sampler_pid=</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">out=</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 只清理本脚本创建的服务端和采样进程，不操作 NE。</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">cleanup() {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  for child in "$sampler_pid" "$server_pid"; do</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    if [ -n "$child" ]; then</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">      kill "$child" 2&gt;/dev/null || true</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">      wait "$child" 2&gt;/dev/null || true</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    fi</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  done</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">trap cleanup EXIT</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">trap 'exit 130' INT</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">trap 'exit 143' TERM</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">iperf() {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  /usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin "$@"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">iperf --version</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">target=$(dscacheutil -q host -a name "$domain" |</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  awk '/^ip_address: / {print $2; exit}')</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">if [ -z "$target" ]; then</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  echo "无法取得域名的 IPv4 地址，请检查 Loon DNS。" &gt;&amp;2</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  exit 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">fi</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ne_pid=$(pgrep -f '/com[.]loon[.]Loon[.]LoonTunnelExtension$' || true)</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">if ! [[ "$ne_pid" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  echo "没有找到唯一的 Loon NE 进程，请先确认 VPN 已连接。" &gt;&amp;2</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  exit 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">fi</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ne_start=$(ps -p "$ne_pid" -o lstart=)</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 每项前后确认还是同一个 NE，并且目标仍走 TUN。</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">check_path() {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  test "$(ps -p "$ne_pid" -o lstart=)" = "$ne_start"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  test "$(ps -p "$ne_pid" -o comm= | awk -F/ '{print $NF}')" = "$bundle"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  route -n get "$target" |</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    awk '$1 == "interface:" &amp;&amp; $2 ~ /^utun[0-9]+$/ {ok=1}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">         END {exit !ok}'</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">check_path</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">out=$(mktemp -d "$PWD/loon-ne-tcp.XXXXXX")</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">printf '%s\n' "$target" &gt; "$out/target.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">route -n get "$target" &gt; "$out/route.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sw_vers &gt; "$out/system.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">iperf --version &gt; "$out/iperf-version.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ps -p "$ne_pid" -o pid= -o lstart= -o comm= &gt; "$out/ne-process.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">printf 'idle\n' &gt; "$out/phase.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">printf 'epoch,phase,rss_kib,cpu_percent\n' &gt; "$out/rss.csv"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># RSS 单位为 KiB；仅代表 NE，不含 iperf 和宿主 App。</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sample_rss() {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  while true; do</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    values=$(ps -p "$ne_pid" -o rss= -o %cpu=) || break</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    read -r rss cpu &lt;&lt;&lt; "$values"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    if ! [[ "$rss" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then break; fi</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    printf '%s,%s,%s,%s\n' "$(date +%s)" "$(cat "$out/phase.txt")" \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">      "$rss" "$cpu" &gt;&gt; "$out/rss.csv"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    sleep 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  done</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  printf 'NE RSS 采样中断\n' &gt; "$out/sampling-error.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sample_rss &amp;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sampler_pid=$!</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -s -B 127.0.0.1 -p "$port" &gt; "$out/server.txt" 2&gt;&amp;1 &amp;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">server_pid=$!</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sleep 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">if ! kill -0 "$server_pid" 2&gt;/dev/null; then</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  echo "服务端未启动，请查看 $out/server.txt（可能端口被占用）。" &gt;&amp;2</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  exit 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">fi</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">echo "结果目录：$out"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">echo "空载观察 10 秒，请暂停其他业务。"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sleep 10</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">run_case() {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  local name=$1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  shift</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  check_path</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  printf '%s\n' "$name" &gt; "$out/phase.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  iperf -c "$target" -4 -p "$port" -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    --connect-timeout 3000 --get-server-output "$@" |</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">    tee "$out/$name.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  check_path</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  printf 'between_cases\n' &gt; "$out/phase.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  sleep 2</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">run_case tcp_up_p1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">run_case tcp_down_p1 -R</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">run_case tcp_up_p4 -P 4</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">run_case tcp_down_p4 -P 4 -R</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">echo "吞吐结束，继续观察 RSS 30 秒。"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">printf 'recovery_0_5s\n' &gt; "$out/phase.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sleep 5</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">printf 'recovery_5_15s\n' &gt; "$out/phase.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sleep 10</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">printf 'recovery_15_30s\n' &gt; "$out/phase.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sleep 15</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">check_path</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">kill -0 "$sampler_pid"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">test ! -f "$out/sampling-error.txt"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">kill "$sampler_pid"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">wait "$sampler_pid" 2&gt;/dev/null || true</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">sampler_pid=</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 将采样 RSS 换算为 MiB，输出每个阶段的采样峰值。</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">awk -F, 'NR&gt;1 {if ($3&gt;peak[$2]) peak[$2]=$3}</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  END {for (phase in peak) printf "%-20s %.2f MiB\n",phase,peak[phase]/1024}' \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">  "$out/rss.csv" | sort</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">echo "完成。吞吐看各 txt 的 receiver；原始 RSS/CPU 在 $out/rss.csv。"</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>脚本中的 <code>target</code> 来自当前系统 DNS，不是写死的历史 Fake-IP。脚本检查 <code>utun</code> 和进程身份，但不能代替 Loon 自身的连接日志核对；若失败退出，本次结果不应标记为完整有效。它不依赖开发版的 TCP-PERF 日志。</p>
<p><code>rss.csv</code> 的阶段按连续四项划分，后一个场景会继承前一个场景留下的驻留内存。默认保留结果目录便于检查；确认不再需要后可自行删除该目录。不要同时运行自动脚本和下面的手动服务端，以免端口冲突。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="4-手动逐项测试">4. 手动逐项测试<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#4-%E6%89%8B%E5%8A%A8%E9%80%90%E9%A1%B9%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95" class="hash-link" aria-label="4. 手动逐项测试的直接链接" title="4. 手动逐项测试的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>终端一启动服务端，仅监听本机回环：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -s -B 127.0.0.1 -p 5201</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>终端二依次执行以下命令，每项完成后间隔约 2 秒：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 单流上传</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 单流下载</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 -R</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 四流上传</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 -P 4</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 四流下载</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/usr/bin/arch -arm64 /usr/bin/iperf3-darwin -c bench.loon.test -4 -p 5201 -O 2 -t 10 -i 1 -P 4 -R</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<ul>
<li><code>-O 2</code>：先进行 2 秒预热，预热不计入最终吞吐。</li>
<li><code>-t 10</code>：正式测量 10 秒。</li>
<li><code>-R</code>：反向传输，即服务端发送、客户端接收，对应下载。</li>
<li><code>-P 4</code>：并发四条数据连接，结果看 <code>[SUM] receiver</code>。</li>
<li>单流看最终 <code>receiver</code>，不要拿某一秒的峰值代替整段结果；若输出缺少接收端汇总，查看对应服务端结果。</li>
</ul>
<p>客户端不要改用 <code>localhost</code> 或 <code>127.0.0.1</code>。服务端绑定 <code>127.0.0.1</code> 是正确的，因为它是 Loon 出口连接的目标；客户端直接连接这个地址则会绕过 TUN。</p>
<p>测试结束后，在服务端终端按 <code>Ctrl+C</code>。如需持续观察内存，优先使用上面的自动脚本；临时查看 NE RSS / CPU 可以执行：</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">pgrep -fl 'com[.]loon[.]Loon[.]LoonTunnelExtension'</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain"># 将 12345 替换为上面实际找到的 NE PID</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">ps -p 12345 -o pid= -o rss= -o %cpu= -o comm=</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>这里 <code>rss</code> 的单位为 KiB，除以 1024 得到 MiB。活动监视器的“内存”列不一定与 <code>ps</code> 的 RSS 同口径，不能直接混在同一张对比表中。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="5-确认流量经过-loon">5. 确认流量经过 Loon<a href="https://loon0x00.github.io/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance#5-%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87-loon" class="hash-link" aria-label="5. 确认流量经过 Loon的直接链接" title="5. 确认流量经过 Loon的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>除测试前的 DNS 和路由检查外，还应在 Loon 请求记录中找到本次 <code>bench.loon.test:5201</code> 的 TCP 连接，确认策略为 DIRECT。单流测试通常还会出现额外的 iperf 控制连接，四流也不是只出现四条总连接。</p>
<p>开发诊断版可以进一步关联 TCP 栈的实际收发字节、写入和 ACK 计数。本轮采用了这一步来验证路径；普通用户版本没有这些计数时，不应把“没有诊断日志”当作没有经过 TCP 栈。</p>
<p>保存对比结果时，建议同时记录：Loon 与扩展版本、芯片和内存、系统版本、iperf 版本、MTU、流数、是否重启 NE、测试顺序、接收吞吐、NE RSS 空载/峰值/停流值。只有测试条件一致，版本之间的速度与内存差异才有解释价值。</p>]]></content>
